@startuml phase2-before
title Faz 2 - ONCE (Faz 1 sonu durumu)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

abstract class Character {
  + name: str
  + element: str
  + ability_name: str
  + hp / max_hp / attack_power
  + is_player: bool
  + frozen_turns: int     <<status field>>
}

class FireCharacter
class CryoCharacter
class ElectroCharacter
class HydroCharacter

Character <|-- FireCharacter
Character <|-- CryoCharacter
Character <|-- ElectroCharacter
Character <|-- HydroCharacter

class GameEngine {
  + player_team: list[Character]   <<ham liste>>
  + enemy_team:  list[Character]   <<ham liste>>
  + turn / log / winner
  --
  + attack(attacker, target)
  + use_ability(character, target_index)
  + tick_status(character)
  + check_game_over()
  + render()
  ..
  - alive(team): list[Character]
  - HP-cap dongusu (saldiri & yetenek sonrasinda iki yerde tekrar)
  - AoE bloklari (Hydro->Electro, Thunder Chain, Tidal Wave)
}

GameEngine "1" *-- "*" Character : holds in list

note right of Character
  Status efekti tek tip: frozen_turns: int.
  Yeni etki = Character'a yeni field.
end note

note right of GameEngine
  AoE her seferinde ayni dongu tekrari:
    for c in self.alive(team): c.hp -= dmg
  HP-cap hack iki ayri yerde:
    for c in team: if c.hp < 0: c.hp = 0
  Yapisal compose noktasi yok.
end note

@enduml
